  "journey": [
    {"id":"overview","place":null,"component":null,"visits":[],"title":"One wish, shipped","text":"nana is a city that turns one wish into shipped work. Scroll to follow one request through it."},
    {"id":"signal","place":"tower","component":null,"visits":[],"title":"A signal arrives","text":"The owner sends a wish from far away. It falls on the reception tower as a pulse of light."},
    {"id":"compass","place":"tower","component":"compass","visits":["court","style"],"title":"The reception tower","text":"The seat works in the tower at the centre. It decodes the wish, checks the rulings and sends the work into the park. Questions go back up as asks."},
    {"id":"drafting-table","place":"drafting","component":"drafting-table","visits":["records"],"title":"The drafting office","text":"A planner draws the plan and the tests it must pass. An adversary at the next desk tries to break them before anyone builds."},
    {"id":"queue","place":"yard","component":"queue","visits":["night-depot"],"title":"The dispatch yard","text":"Plans wait here for a free bay. Two lanes build at once, and a third can be planned alongside."},
    {"id":"workshop","place":"bay-1","component":"workshop","visits":["tools","guards","survey"],"title":"The workshop bays","text":"A builder crew takes the plan into a bay and builds it. The library theater broadcasts the memory the lane needs."},
    {"id":"eyes","place":"inspection","component":"eyes","visits":["test-lab","control"],"title":"Inspection","text":"The visual judge holds each build against its reference picture. A failed check sends the work back to its bay."},
    {"id":"review-ladder","place":"ladder","component":"review-ladder","visits":[],"title":"The review ladder","text":"Reviewers from a different model family read the change. Work on gates, hooks and installs climbs extra rungs."},
    {"id":"land-gate","place":"land-gate","component":"land-gate","visits":["vault"],"title":"The land gate","text":"The gate opens only when every reviewer says LAND and CI is green. It is the park's only way out."},
    {"id":"identity-scan","place":"customs","component":"identity-scan","visits":[],"title":"Customs","text":"At the city edge, customs scans the cargo for anything that names the owner or their work."},
    {"id":"release-route","place":"freight","component":"release-route","visits":["utilities","billboard","stage"],"title":"The freight road","text":"Release carries templates and setup out of the city. The billboard shows what shipped."},
    {"id":"customers","place":"customers","component":null,"visits":[],"title":"Customer towns","text":"Other projects built the nana way receive the work. Their feedback rises to the sky as new signals."},
    {"id":"library","place":"theater","component":"library","visits":[],"title":"The way back","text":"Each lane's findings return to the library theater as new tapes, so the next lane starts knowing more."},
    {"id":"closing","place":null,"component":null,"visits":[],"title":"The whole city","text":"The tower at the centre, the factory park around it, the town around that, and one road out. Dark buildings are parts still to come."}
  ],
